# UI operator guide sync

User-facing “what does this button do?” docs live under `docs/ui/`.

## When you must update

If you **add, remove, rename, enable/disable, or change the API** of any control on a web tab (button, toggle, pill, link that triggers work), update:

1. Matching file in `docs/ui/` (e.g. Market → `docs/ui/market.md`)
2. `docs/ui/README.md` — “What you can do right now” and/or suggested flow if capability changed
3. `docs/ui/status-bar.md` — if header pills or mode semantics changed

Skeleton → live: replace “Controls today: None” with a full controls table (Control · API · What happens).

